# sk-end -- the skirmish LOSE path, fast: start the default skirmish, remove
# every house-0 object (dev cheat), and require the session to end LOST through
# the real GameScene: `outcome` flips at the defeat (Flag_To_Lose), the result
# scene follows after BorrowedTime (90 frames, docs/re/mcv-deploy.md §5). The WIN path is the last
# section of sk-a.play. EXPECTED TO FAIL on master 63edea6 (G-02).
set render_every 300
click button "Single Player"
click button Skirmish
click start
until 90 scene == game
require scene == game
cheat kill_house 0
until 60 world_outcome == LOST
until 900 outcome == LOST                     @G-02:F
until 300 scene == result                     @G-02:F
shot lost
if scene == result then click menu
until 60 scene == "shell:Main Menu"           @G-02:F
end
